WEBVTT

00:09:57.343 --> 00:10:00.512
ended up being 12,000.

00:10:01.555 --> 00:10:04.350
All eager to draw a dog.

00:10:05.392 --> 00:10:06.727
The next day,

00:10:06.727 --> 00:10:09.396
14,000 kids came

00:10:09.438 --> 00:10:11.690
and we drew a tree,

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:15.194
and that drawing exercise
that you all just did.

00:10:15.861 --> 00:10:20.157
What was supposed to be
five minutes for five days,

00:10:20.199 --> 00:10:22.743
ended up being 30 minutes a day,

00:10:22.743 --> 00:10:24.620
five days a week,

00:10:24.662 --> 00:10:26.330
for months.

00:10:26.955 --> 00:10:30.084
And yeah, we talked about line and shape